      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebuild what though? the name is toxic now. the reputation is trashed. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person, just a cautionary tale. it's not like there's a \"new chapter\" for someone like me. the book is closed. it's just... exhausting to keep pretending there's a point to any of this.",
